			"notes": "### New commands\nVanish command now has bulk vanish capabilities.\n- \"/vanish all\" / \"/vanish all true\" vanishes all players\n- \"/vanish all false\" unvanishes all players\n- \"/vanish <target>\" toggle vanish on target\n- \"/vanish <target> <true/false>\" set vanish on target\n- \"/vanish reload\" reload settings file\n\n### New Settings\n- \"persistent\" vanish status is persistent over restarts (default: enabled)\n- \"logVanishToConsole\" vanishing get's logged to server console (default: disabled)\n- \"logUnvanishToConsole\" **un**vanishing get's logged to server console (default: disabled)\n\n### other features\n- settings file now adds all new options on server start"
		},
